ovich","x":"We've seen things like streaming growing slower than it used to be.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/23/dlocal-limited-dlo-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"DLO 2022 Q3","e":"dlo","d":"2022-11-15","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Maria Oldham","x":"In Q3 2022, our top 10 merchants were spread across various verticals, including ride hailing, commerce, streaming, advertising, financial services, and on-demand delivery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/15/dlocal-limited-dlo-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"DLO 2022 Q3","e":"dlo","d":"2022-11-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Seba Kanovich","x":"And if anything, you've seen many of them doing layoffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/15/dlocal-limited-dlo-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"DLO 2022 Q3","e":"dlo","d":"2022-11-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Seba Kanovich","x":"What we've seen in the past is that when layoffs happen, typically, our services become more muted because they do outsource more of that work for us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/15/dlocal-limited-dlo-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"DLO 2025 Q3","e":"dlo","d":"2025-11-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Pedro Arnt","x":"On a quarter-over-quarter basis, gross profit increased by 4%, primarily driven by volume growth across frontier markets with strong performance in Colombia, Bolivia and Nigeria and Brazil's solid growth across streaming, e-commerce and advertising, coupled with higher share of pay-ins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/13/dlocal-dlo-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DLO 2025 Q3","e":"dlo","d":"2025-11-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Pedro Arnt","x":"I mean, hovering at around that 50% average, you have our streaming business, Software-as-a-Service merchants, on-demand delivery merchants, ride-hailing merchants.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/13/dlocal-dlo-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DLO 2025 Q3","e":"dlo","d":"2025-11-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Pedro Arnt","x":"Our revenue per employee had a second quarter of strong growth as we realized gains from our investment cycle and reaped initial returns on our automation and AI projects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/13/dlocal-dlo-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DLO 2025 Q3","e":"dlo","d":"2025-11-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Pedro Arnt","x":"…macro situation in Argentina, temporary cost pressure in Mexico, potentially also headwinds from tariffs in that market and a full quarter's effect of the share of wallet losses in Egypt that we had already referenced in the second quarter. As anticipated, our investment cycle increased head…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/13/dlocal-dlo-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DLO 2025 Q3","e":"dlo","d":"2025-11-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Pedro Arnt","x":"…reflecting lower interest rate spreads and a temporary increase in processing costs and a payment mix shift towards an APM with temporary margin pressure in Mexico as well as a slowdown in TPV growth, likely driven by increased tariffs on imports as we have cautioned in our last guidance update.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/13/dlocal-dlo-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DLO 2025 Q3","e":"dlo","d":"2025-11-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Pedro Arnt","x":"We reiterate our guidance numbers given where we see the business tracking as of today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/13/dlocal-dlo-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DLO 2025 Q4","e":"dlo","d":"2026-03-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Guillermo Perez","x":"Brazil led the growth where we saw very strong seasonal e-